Create a buffer stream using `SoLoud.instance.setBufferStream` with the desired buffering type, sample rate, channels, and format. Play the stream with `await SoLoud.instance.play(stream)`. As audio data arrives, feed each chunk to the stream by calling `SoLoud.instance.addAudioDataStream(stream, audioChunk)`, and when all data has been sent, mark the stream as finished with `SoLoud.instance.setDataIsEnded(stream)`. ```dart
final stream = SoLoud.instance.setBufferStream(
  bufferingType: BufferingType.released,
  sampleRate: 24000,
  channels: Channels.mono,
  format: BufferType.s16le,
);
final handle = await SoLoud.instance.play(stream);
SoLoud.instance.addAudioDataStream(stream, audioChunk);
SoLoud.instance.setDataIsEnded(stream);
```

